{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:41:21+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:41:21+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Bonduelle SCA","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"France","city":"Villeneuve-d'Ascq","website":"https://www.bonduelle.com","employees":7445,"summary":"Bonduelle SCA provides plant-based products in France, the United States, Southern Europe, Germany, Eurasia, Northern Europe, Central and Eastern Europe, and internationally. It operates through Canned, Frozen, and Fresh segments. The company offers canned, frozen, and ready-to-use fresh vegetables, including peas, corn, pickles, and letcho. It also provides ambient, processed fresh, and prepared vegetables. In addition, the company engages in mass and commercial catering; and reinsurance activities. It sells its products under the Bonduelle, Cassegrain, and Globus brands through retail and B2B channels, including traditional restaurants and hotels, catering and reception services, themed restaurants, fast food and take-away outlets, and group catering providers. Bonduelle SCA was founded in 1853 and is headquartered in Villeneuve-d'Ascq, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Bonduelle SCA fournit des produits d’origine végétale en France, aux États-Unis, en Europe du Sud, en Allemagne, en Eurasie, en Europe du Nord, en Europe centrale et orientale et à l’international. Il opère à travers des segments Conserves, Frozen et Fresh. La société propose des légumes frais en conserve, surgelés et prêts à l'emploi, notamment des pois, du maïs, des cornichons et du letcho."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":273238464,"shares_outstanding":31920380,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":6.452245,"price_to_book":0.4365343,"ev_to_ebitda":6.562,"ev_to_revenue":0.39,"dividend_yield":0.028900001,"payout_ratio":0.35979998,"beta_yahoo":0.3